It's _a_ "Big Room". There are 5 different "Big Room" room layouts
available in Nethack, in each game one (at most) may or may not be
incorporated into the dungeon layout (40% probability). Rooms of
this type are open area with a couple of consequences; many hostile
monsters will approach the direct way towards you, on most places
on that level you may be easily surrounded by monsters, and others
are queuing if the first row should fall, you see many interesting
objects as soon as you enter the level, though the monsters might
reach the objects before you and use them against you.

The bigroom you posted is the best one of all available because you
can retreat in niches where "only" three monsters can simultaneously
hit you. Nevertheless it's a tough place. You should have enough HPs
and AC to survive missile and wand attacks. The typical tactics is
to stay on the upstairs, kill critters as long as you safely can and
climb upstairs in time to heal if you're getting low on HPs.

